00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:11.391 line:78%
IN OUR COMMUNITIES.

00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:13.159 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Lawrence: KING, I HAVE BEEN

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:14.194 line:78%
SO PROUD OF YOUR TRAJECTORY

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.328 line:78%
